    mc "Es gibt einen Haken."

# game/code/book-2/chapter-11/s14.rpy:252
translate deutsch b2c11s14_01d61a78:

    # cb "Well, duh. What, you want another round of this ass? Because the second time is more expensive than the first, heh."
